# https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyProcess node157
node157 [ shape=none, color=black label=< <table color='#666666' cellborder='0' cellspacing='0' border='1'><tr><td colspan='2' bgcolor='grey'><B>ModifyProcess</B></td></tr><tr><td href='https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyProcess' bgcolor='#eeeeee' colspan='2'><font point-size='10' color='#6666ff'>https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/SupplyChain/ModifyProcess</font></td></tr><tr><td align='left'>rdfs:comment</td><td align='left'>&quot;A prescribed alteration of a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:definition</td><td align='left'>&quot;A prescribed alteration of a product.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A ModifyProcess is a process that will result in the alteration of a product, such as a change to its configuration or its location.

Relationship:

For each ModifyProcess there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;hasOutput’ on the from and a /Core/Element subclass on the to.

